    <string name="i18n_g3_connect_your_strap_to_arm_this">Connect your strap to arm this; it\'s set on the strap\'s own firmware alarm. Confirmed working on WHOOP 4.0; still experimental on 5.0 and MG. Keep a backup alarm for anything you truly can\'t miss.</string>
