    <string name="i18n_g3_continuously_append_the_strap_log_to">Continuously append the strap log to a rolling on-device file (≤8 MB, one previous generation kept) so a long-running issue — battery drain, an overnight offload — is captured for hours instead of the ~50 minutes the in-memory share holds. Keeps going if the app is killed and resumes on next launch. The file stays on the phone unless you share it below.</string>
